  "question": {
    "text": "In a class of <math><mn>60</mn></math> students, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math> opted for NCC, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math> opted for NSS and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> opted for both NCC and NSS. If one of these students is selected at random, then the probability that the student selected has opted neither for NCC nor for NSS is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;be the sets for NCC and NSS respectively.</p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>B</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
